## ✅ Conclusion

This project demonstrates how **Natural Language Processing and Machine Learning** can be combined to automatically classify Twitter text into positive, negative, and neutral sentiments.

By comparing Naive Bayes and Logistic Regression, evaluating their performance using multiple metrics, and analysing model errors, the project provides a practical understanding of **text classification and sentiment analysis**.

The resulting system can serve as a foundation for analysing customer feedback, social media opinions, and other large-scale text data.

